
Examples of gas-phase SOS-FEP calculations using 
5, 6, 11, 15 or 21 windows. 
11 is recommended for typical A->B FEP calculations
with addition/removal of zero or 1 non-H atom.
PhXgas11 contains input files for PhX -> PhY perturbations.

xSOSGASn can be run from any directory.

xDELGSOSgas is used to collect the results at the
end of the FEP calculation.
